# Universal project ignore rules
# Copy this file to .gitignore for Git and/or .ignore for ripgrep and other tools.
# Keep source, manifests, lock files, documentation, tests, and intentional fixtures.
# Remove a rule when a project deliberately tracks a matching path.

# Operating system files
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
.Spotlight-V100/
.Trashes/
.fseventsd/
.VolumeIcon.icns
Icon?
Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
ehthumbs.db
ehthumbs_vista.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# Editors and IDEs
*~
.#*
*.swp
*.swo
*.swn
*.bak
*.tmp
*.orig
*.rej
.idea/
.fleet/
*.iml
*.iws
*.sublime-workspace
.vscode/*.log
.history/

